# Build and Dependency Management

Project dependencies and build scripts are managed using Node.js tools.

*   **`package.json`**: This [package.json](mdc:package.json) file lists project dependencies (like Tailwind CSS, Prettier, Vite) and defines scripts for common tasks such as building assets, linting, and formatting. Refer to the `scripts` section within this file for available commands.
*   **`pnpm-lock.yaml`**: This [pnpm-lock.yaml](mdc:pnpm-lock.yaml) file is automatically generated by pnpm and ensures deterministic installs of dependencies. It should not be manually edited.
*   **`.npmrc`**: This [.npmrc](mdc:.npmrc) file contains configuration settings for npm, potentially including which package manager to use (e.g. pnpm).
